reon.com/yablon_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_8adcbd14-1f48-412c-98b4-f03dea701632.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">📖 **关于**</h2><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">欢迎来到 **家具模组 (Furnitury Mod)**，内含 **超过 200 种独特家具和装饰物品**！用时尚且实用的家具改造你的 Minecraft 建筑，从舒适的沙发到现代椅子，为每个房间增添魅力和个性。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede